1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,028
Then the show.

2
00:00:01,028 --> 00:00:03,398
The cowherds burst into loud weeping.

3
00:00:03,398 --> 00:00:09,414
Jitman cries that he is an orphan now; the king gives him four hundred rupees.

4
00:00:09,414 --> 00:00:17,382
Gore says the bull was dearer to him than his parents, wife and children, and that he will hang himself; he gets five hundred.

5
00:00:17,382 --> 00:00:19,166
Laxminarayan weeps too.

6
00:00:19,166 --> 00:00:24,882
They escape death by performing grief for an animal they resented, and are paid for it.

7
00:00:24,882 --> 00:00:27,226
The ending is funny, and bitter.

